# Quick play on a fresh profile starts lesson 1: its text on the countdown's first beat, then the gas
# held to the green flag; the results offer the next lesson, which starts with its own text; Escape
# pauses it and Quit to title returns to the title.
until 300 Hillwheel
frames 150
click =Quick play — learn the basics
until 60 Hold GAS
frames 10
save lesson-1-intro
hold KeyW
until 300 m to the flag
frames 240
save lesson-1-driving
until 1200 Finished!
release KeyW
frames 20
expect Give it throttle complete
save lesson-1-results
click =Next lesson
until 120 Hold BRAKE
frames 240
key Escape 2
until 60 Resume
frames 10
save lesson-2-paused
click =Quit to title
until 120 Quick play
frames 10
